{"id":"seltsam","lemma":"seltsam","pos":"adv","rank":759,"glosses":["strangely, weirdly, oddly, curiously"],"ipa":"/ˈzɛltˌzaːm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/51/De-at-seltsam.ogg/De-at-seltsam.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ist dies seltsam?","en":"Is this strange?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,null]},{"text":"Alles ist so seltsam.","en":"Everything is so strange.","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"so"},null]},{"text":"Viele finden mich seltsam.","en":"A lot of people find me strange.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"to find"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},null]},{"text":"Es ist sehr seltsam.","en":"It's very odd.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/746765","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Die Leute hier sind seltsam.","en":"People here are strange.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null]}]}